msgstr ""
"Software kon je inloggegevens niet in de sleutelbos bewaren. Je moet de "
"volgende keer opnieuw inloggen."

#. TRANSLATORS: the keyring entry's name, as a password manager shows it; %s is the store's address
#: src/sw-account.c
#, c-format
msgid "VibeOS Software: the store account on %s"
msgstr "VibeOS Software: het Store-account op %s"

#: src/sw-account.c
msgid "You were signed out of the store. Sign in again to review apps."
msgstr "Je bent uitgelogd bij de Store. Log opnieuw in om apps te beoordelen."

#. TRANSLATORS: %u is the HTTP status code
#: src/sw-api.c
#, c-format
msgid "The store is not working right now (error %u). Try again later."
msgstr "De Store werkt nu niet (fout %u). Probeer het later opnieuw."

